Suppressed diocese → successor see. If <code>SucceededBy IS NOT NULL</code> is invalid in your Cargo version, store a boolean <code>IsSuppressed</code> and filter on that. No successor column in OrgDemo.

== Wikitext ==

<pre>
{{#saintapedia_graph:
tables=Dioceses
|fields=_pageName,SucceededBy,Country
|where=SucceededBy IS NOT NULL
|source_field=_pageName
|target_field=SucceededBy
|direction=LR
|clickable=yes
}}
</pre>

